{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-isa-25-1","title":"Isaiah 25:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>Re 5:9-14; 7:12 thou hast. Ps 40:5; 46:10; 78:4; 98:1; 107:8-43; 111:4; Da 4:2,3; Re 15:3 thy counsels. 28:29; 46:10; Nu 23:19; Ps 33:10,11; Jer 32:17-24; Eze 38:17-23 Ro 11:25-29; Eph 1:11; Heb 6:17,18; Re 19:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-25-2","title":"Isaiah 25:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>For. 12; 14:23; 17:1; 21:9; 23:13; De 13:16; Jer 51:26; Na 3:12-15 palace. 13:22; Re 18:2,3,19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-25-3","title":"Isaiah 25:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>49:23-26; 60:10-14; 66:18-20; Ps 46:10,11; 66:3; 72:8-11; Eze 38:23 Eze 39:21,22; Zec 14:9,16; Re 11:13,15-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-25-4","title":"Isaiah 25:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>thou hast. 11:4; 14:32; 29:19; 33:2; 66:2; Job 5:15,16; Ps 12:5; 35:10 Ps 72:4,13; 107:41; 119:31; Zep 3:12; Jas 2:5 a refuge. 4:5,6; 32:2 when. 32:18,19; 37:3,4,36; Eze 13:11-13; Mt 7:25-27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-25-5","title":"Isaiah 25:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>shalt bring. 10:8-15,32-34; 13:11; 14:10-16; 17:12-14; 30:30-33; 49:25,26 54:15-17; 64:1,2; Ps 74:3-23; 79:10-12; Jer 50:11-15 Jer 51:38-43,53-57; Eze 32:18-32; 38:9-23; 39:1-10; Da 7:23-27 Da 11:36-45; Re 16:1-19:21; 20:8,9 as the heat. 18:4; 49:10; Ps 105:39; Jon 4:5,6 branch. 14:19; Job 8:16-19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-25-6","title":"Isaiah 25:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>in this. 10; 2:2,3; Ps 72:14-16; 78:68; Mic 4:1,2; Zec 8:3; Heb 12:22 make. 55:1,2; Ps 63:5; Pr 9:1-5; So 2:3-5; 5:1; Jer 31:12,13; Zec 9:16,17 Mt 22:1-10; Lu 14:16-23; 22:30; Re 19:9 all people. 49:6-10; Da 7:14; Mt 8:11; Mr 16:15 of wines. So 1:2,4; Jer 48:11; Mt 26:29; Lu 5:39</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-25-7","title":"Isaiah 25:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>he will. 60:1-3; Mt 27:51; Lu 2:32; Ac 17:30; 2Co 3:13-18; Eph 3:5,6; 4:18 Eph 5:8; Heb 9:8,24; 10:19-21 destroy. Heb. swallow up. cast. Heb. covered.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-25-8","title":"Isaiah 25:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>He. Ho 13:14; 1Co 15:26,54; 2Ti 1:10; Heb 2:14,15; Re 20:14; 21:4 God. 35:10; Re 7:17; 21:4 rebuke. 30:26; 37:3; 54:4; 60:15; 61:7; 66:5; Ps 69:9; 89:50,51; Mt 5:11,12 1Pe 4:14 off. Mal 3:17,18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-25-9","title":"Isaiah 25:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>it shall. 12:1; Zep 3:14-20; Re 1:7; 19:1-7 Lo. 8:17; 26:8,9; 30:18,19; Ge 49:18; Ps 27:14; 37:5-7; 62:1,2,5-7 Mic 7:7; Lu 2:25,28-30; Ro 8:23-25; Tit 2:13; 2Pe 3:12; Re 22:20 we will. 12:2-6; 66:10-14; Ps 9:14; 20:5; 21:1; 95:1; 100:1; Zec 9:9 Ro 5:2,3; Php 3:1,3; 1Pe 1:6,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-25-10","title":"Isaiah 25:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>in this. 6; 11:10; 12:6; 18:4; Ps 132:13,14; Eze 48:35; Zep 3:15-17 Zec 9:9-11 Moab. 11:14; 15:1-16:14; Nu 24:17; Zep 2:9 trodden down. or, threshed. 41:15,16; Mic 4:13 even. 5:25; 10:6; 14:19; 26:6; Ps 83:10; La 1:15 for the dunghill. or, in Madmenah. 10:31; Jer 48:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-25-11","title":"Isaiah 25:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>he shall spread. 5:25; 14:26; 65:2; Col 2:15 he shall bring. 5; 2:11; 10:33; 13:11; 16:6; 53:12; Ps 2:5,8-12; 110:1-7 Jer 48:29,42; 50:31,32; 51:44; Da 4:37; Jas 4:6; Re 18:6-8 Re 19:18-20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-25-12","title":"Isaiah 25:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>the fortress. 26:5; Jer 51:58,64; 2Co 10:4,5; Heb 11:30; Re 18:21 to the dust. 13:19-22; 14:23</p>"}]}